---
import CafeLayout from '../../layouts/CafeLayout.astro';
import { cafeProducts } from '../../data/brands.js';
const featured = cafeProducts.slice(0, 3);
---
<CafeLayout active="home" title="Beranda" description="Amber & Bean Coffee Roasters — specialty coffee, pastry, dan tempat singgah yang tenang.">
  <section class="c-hero">
    <div class="c-wrap c-hero-grid">
      <div class="c-hero-copy">
        <p class="c-kicker">Roasted slowly · Served thoughtfully</p>
        <h1 class="c-display">Coffee for<br />unhurried days.</h1>
        <p class="c-lede">Amber &amp; Bean meracik specialty coffee dengan karakter caramel, cocoa, dan citrus yang bersih—disandingkan dengan pastry hangat dan ruang yang nyaman untuk ngobrol, membaca, atau menyelesaikan deadline.</p>
        <div class="c-hero-actions">
          <a class="c-button c-button--dark" href="/cafe/produk/">Lihat menu</a>
          <a class="c-button c-button--light" href="/cafe/kontak/">Jam buka &amp; kontak</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="c-hero-visual">
        <div class="c-hero-photo"><img src="https://unsplash.com/photos/eN9vH3SSrIA/download?force=true&w=1600" alt="Barista menyiapkan kopi di coffee bar" /></div>
        <div class="c-hero-note"><strong>Daily roast.</strong><span>Small-batch beans, dialled in every shift.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="c-section c-section--paper">
    <div class="c-wrap c-section-head">
      <div><p class="c-kicker">The room</p><h2 class="c-title">Warm light.<br />Good coffee.<br />No rush.</h2></div>
      <p class="c-lede">Bukan sekadar tempat “aesthetic”. Fokusnya tetap secangkir kopi yang konsisten, meja yang benar-benar nyaman dipakai, dan ambience yang tidak mengganggu percakapan.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="c-wrap c-room-grid">
      <figure><img src="https://unsplash.com/photos/GX6_yPidVoQ/download?force=true&w=1600" alt="Coffee shop hangat dengan pastry dan barista" /></figure>
      <figure><img src="https://unsplash.com/photos/_yJXuiFdsPo/download?force=true&w=1200" alt="Interior coffee shop yang nyaman" /></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="c-section">
    <div class="c-wrap c-principles">
      <div><p class="c-kicker">How we work</p><h2 class="c-title">Small details make the cup.</h2><p class="c-lede" style="margin-top:1.5rem">Dari profiling roast sampai temperatur air, kami menjaga hal-hal kecil yang bikin rasa tetap stabil dari pagi sampai malam.</p></div>
      <div class="c-principle-list">
        <article class="c-principle"><span>01</span><div><h3>Roast in small batches.</h3><p>Profil medium-light supaya origin character tetap terbaca.</p></div></article>
        <article class="c-principle"><span>02</span><div><h3>Dial in every shift.</h3><p>Grinder, dose, dan extraction dicek ulang saat kondisi ruang berubah.</p></div></article>
        <article class="c-principle"><span>03</span><div><h3>Serve without theatre.</h3><p>Teknik penting, tapi pengalaman minum tetap harus terasa sederhana.</p></div></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="c-section c-section--paper">
    <div class="c-wrap c-section-head">
      <div><p class="c-kicker">Popular right now</p><h2 class="c-title">Start with these.</h2></div>
      <p class="c-lede">Tiga pilihan yang paling mudah jadi pintu masuk—dari cold brew yang clean sampai pastry yang paling aman buat pairing.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="c-wrap c-feature-row">
      {featured.map((item) => (
        <article class="c-feature">
          <small>{item.category} · {item.price}</small>
          <h3>{item.name}</h3>
          <p>{item.note}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="c-wrap" style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a class="c-button c-button--light" href="/cafe/produk/">Buka seluruh menu →</a></div>
  </section>
</CafeLayout>
